1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,512
Meet Genie Bot, a friendly data assistant living in a bakery.

2
00:00:04,562 --> 00:00:10,381
It runs as a Databricks App and answers from a Genie agent over your Bakehouse data.

3
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:16,103
The chalkboard shows live revenue and top customers from your dashboard.

4
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:17,879
Tap it to open dashboards.

5
00:00:18,731 --> 00:00:24,536
The tickets are the last three runs of the daily job, and the oven light shows pipeline health.

6
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:29,436
The recipe book is your catalog, with each table's freshness.

7
00:00:31,593 --> 00:00:33,560
Ask anything in plain English.

8
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:39,881
Genie Bot acts out what Genie is doing: finding data, planning the query, running the numbers.

9
00:00:42,955 --> 00:00:48,733
Genie Bot: Here is the daily revenue for the last 29 days returned by the query; these dates are all from simulated test data, not real business activity.

10
00:00:48,783 --> 00:00:50,933
Genie Bot: A few representative values include: October 30: 3933.

11
00:00:51,083 --> 00:00:54,371
Answers come with a chart, or switch to the table.

12
00:00:56,508 --> 00:01:00,414
Pull the lamp chain to dim the room, and the panels go dark.

13
00:01:03,906 --> 00:01:08,602
If the daily job fails, Genie Bot tells you, with a link to the run.

14
00:01:09,454 --> 00:01:14,896
The menu lists everything you can ask or do, including hands-free chat with the mic.

15
00:01:15,748 --> 00:01:20,827
Each croissant is someone here right now, and the counter shows everyone served.

16
00:01:21,677 --> 00:01:28,975
The window follows your clock: the sun and moon move, the moon shows its real phase, and the weather is local.

17
00:01:38,842 --> 00:01:42,104
And when it's quiet, Genie Bot vibes to music.

18
00:01:42,154 --> 00:01:46,064
Click to play or pause, double-click for the next song.

19
00:01:46,114 --> 00:01:48,656
The TV in the counter is the player.

20
00:01:48,706 --> 00:01:49,880
That's Genie Bot!
